/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 753 Tm (SAMPLE DOCUMENT FOR THE PORTAL PROTOTYPE) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 739 Tm (Sample text for the portal prototype. This is not the legal agreement. It stands in for the) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 725 Tm (document the customer signs in the Zeno app when a vehicle is attached to them.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696 Tm (1. What this warranty covers) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 682 Tm (Zeno warrants the vehicle's frame, motor and controller against defects in materials and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (workmanship for 24 months from the date of sale, or 40,000 km, whichever comes first.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 639 Tm (2. What it does not cover) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 625 Tm (Wear parts \(tyres, brake pads, chain and sprockets\), damage from accidents, misuse or) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 611 Tm (unapproved modifications, and vehicles serviced outside the Zeno network.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 582 Tm (3. Your responsibilities) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 568 Tm (Keep the vehicle's scheduled services at a Zeno hub, report faults within 7 days of noticing) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 554 Tm (them, and do not open or modify the vehicle's electronics.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 525 Tm (4. Making a claim) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 511 Tm (Bring the vehicle to any Zeno hub with your customer number. Zeno will inspect it within 3) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 497 Tm (working days and repair or replace covered parts at no cost to you.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 468 Tm (5. Data) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 454 Tm (The vehicle reports its location, odometer and fault codes to Zeno. Zeno uses this data to) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 440 Tm (assess claims and to keep the vehicle safe, as described in the Zeno privacy notice.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 403 Tm (Signed by the customer) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 389 Tm (Signed electronically in the Zeno app. The signer's details and signature) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 375 Tm (record are held by Zeno and shown in the Zeno portal.) Tj
